From 45df1f1e302fe2a0dcc7f87a980bd68e4e688947 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: t <t@t>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 01:54:12 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] ohos: declare the directly used KF6 frameworks as explicit
 links

kdialog calls headers from frameworks it does not link explicitly and
relies on transitive include propagation through the dependency chain
(KWidgetsAddons: KMessageBox/KPasswordDialog/KNewPasswordDialog/
KDatePicker; KCoreAddons: KAboutData; KConfig: KConfig; KI18n:
KLocalizedString, 4 uses).

That propagation exists on a native KF6 installation, but the published
ohpcd KF6 artifacts export only their own ${_IMPORT_PREFIX}-relative
header trees and flatten their dependency linkage into plain -l flags
and -L link directories in the installed Targets files (e.g.
KF6TextWidgetsTargets.cmake carries "-lKF6SonnetUi;-lKF6I18n" plus
absolute INTERFACE_LINK_DIRECTORIES instead of imported-target
references). Consumers therefore get no include directories for the
transitive frameworks and the build fails with:

  kdialog.cpp:16:10: fatal error: 'KMessageBox' file not found

Fix: add the missing components to find_package(KF6 ... COMPONENTS ...)
and link the matching imported targets on the kdialog executable. Note
the KConfig framework is requested under component name "Config", not
"ConfigCore" (the latter is only the target name: KF6::ConfigCore /
KF6::ConfigGui). Declaring frameworks whose headers are used directly
is correct CMake hygiene and is harmless on any KF6 installation (the
targets resolve identically there).

No platform macros: pure package-configuration change (R8 compliant).
---
 CMakeLists.txt     | 2 +-
 src/CMakeLists.txt | 4 ++++
 2 files changed, 5 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/CMakeLists.txt b/CMakeLists.txt
index e3fb7d7..1b375ab 100644
--- a/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -23,7 +23,7 @@ include(ECMDeprecationSettings)
 include(ECMSetupVersion)
 include(FeatureSummary)
 # Build dependencies
-find_package(KF6 ${KF_MIN_VERSION} REQUIRED COMPONENTS TextWidgets Notifications GuiAddons IconThemes WindowSystem KIO DBusAddons)
+find_package(KF6 ${KF_MIN_VERSION} REQUIRED COMPONENTS TextWidgets WidgetsAddons Config CoreAddons I18n Notifications GuiAddons IconThemes WindowSystem KIO DBusAddons)
 find_package(Qt6 ${QT_MIN_VERSION} CONFIG REQUIRED COMPONENTS DBus)
 
 option(WITHOUT_X11 "Build without X11 integration (skips finding X11)" OFF)
diff --git a/src/CMakeLists.txt b/src/CMakeLists.txt
index b8df17f..681e4a2 100644
--- a/src/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/src/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -20,6 +20,10 @@ target_sources(kdialog PRIVATE
 target_link_libraries(kdialog
     KF6::KIOCore
     KF6::TextWidgets
+    KF6::WidgetsAddons
+    KF6::I18n
+    KF6::ConfigCore
+    KF6::CoreAddons
     KF6::Notifications
     KF6::IconThemes
     KF6::GuiAddons
